<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1622] clear() method works incorrectly with near caches</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1622</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently &lt;tt&gt;IgniteCache.clear()&lt;/tt&gt; method doesn&apos;t clear server nodes if there are near entries. Instead it should clear all caches, including near and readers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
